    - rid: 2623125860895687149
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 69cbf49f607b41daa91749d7e21d7743
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: That storm came out of a clear sky. I have been a soldier twenty years and I have never seen the sun simply leave.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687150
      type: {class: ChoiceNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 3007d5e0e89f490f9569f09ddbcd1409
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever waits in there, you should not meet it with your bare hands. We carry spare arms in the packs. They are old and they are plain, but they will do. Take what suits you.
        answers:
        - The sword.
        - The axe.
        - The spear.
        - The club.
        - The bow.
        mustAnswer: 1
        afterFightPause: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687151
