    - rid: 2623125860895687156
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: dbed88c184df40dd82f6d1a3cdf65e5a
        position: {x: 1840, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687157
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 51c043b9d09e4dfc9559a31b2321ac85
        position: {x: 2140, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A soldier's choice. It is old iron, but it holds an edge. Guard well and let them come to you.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687158
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e6df45dba27b427abd54a1d714301e63
        position: {x: 1840, y: 230}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687159
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 50194e265e034ac88edbaae7b4e04434
        position: {x: 2140, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: The axe. Good. It splits wolves and firewood alike, and you keep the torch in your other hand.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687160
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: a2e5a948caa14b16a7d39792df895da1
        position: {x: 1840, y: 400}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687161
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 622587152cdc4c29abb4a079994ec25a
        position: {x: 2140, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Long reach, and it wants both hands, so your torch goes in your pack. Press L to swap them when you need the light.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687162
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: af47a7497ca94001821f30f70bbec410
        position: {x: 1840, y: 570}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687163
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: ccec9e3a44a242a98c872050e0e6bd4a
        position: {x: 2140, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Simple. I respect that. Hit it until it stops, and you keep the torch in your other hand.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687164
      type: {class: RaiseQuestEventNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 45cd098881564d44b78cdbebeba9f2d3
        position: {x: 1840, y: 740}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 99f43a387e2b30a408b5faf35fc3f1f9, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687165
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8de51e46e4754a4ba4e65cae5c4ca41c
        position: {x: 2140, y: 740}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A bow! Then there are two of us. It wants both hands, so your torch went into your pack. Press L to swap bow and torch whenever you need the light. Hold the left button to draw, let go to shoot.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
