    - rid: 2623125860895687092
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 18578f0a0ba6478ca37b320c870f4f69
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Steady now. It is a fine morning to walk into something stupid.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687093
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 5d4304b624904034a3bb8b6eeac5207e
        position: {x: 340, y: 570}
        reaches: 0.3
    - rid: 2623125860895687094
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 373617ad15c147be9b6237ee13282a0d
        position: {x: 640, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Runa
          model: {fileID: 334759803}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: A shepherd told me his dogs won't go past the tree line any more. Dogs. I have seen those dogs go after a bear.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687095
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 699ed26671774a2787ce70896c1b20a6
        position: {x: 340, y: 740}
        reaches: 0.58
    - rid: 2623125860895687096
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 8a69ef9ee6b84cf28c0404afb6c59c66
        position: {x: 640, y: 400}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Rumours grow in the telling. That is why we go and look, instead of sitting in a longhouse and listening.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
    - rid: 2623125860895687097
      type: {class: WaitForWalkNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d85844820f524d93a223d507637ba264
        position: {x: 340, y: 910}
        reaches: 0.85
    - rid: 2623125860895687098
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 11f1843e23b14611a3bd4c252766f922
        position: {x: 640, y: 570}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Eirik
          model: {fileID: 810501267}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Is it past noon already? We have not been walking an hour.
        afterFightPause: 0
        aside: 1
