    - rid: 2623125860895687002
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: acb4554bebbf4534b4bc39a095b7eaa5
        position: {x: 640, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82ba4d914072adf478d4fa857f205026, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687003
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 08cea055bb494cefb199c0e91f5e967d
        position: {x: 940, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: You asked me by the fire, so here it is. I have seen stones like these wake once. It took everyone who stood too near, and it put them somewhere else. Ingrid knew that when she came. Now you do.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687004
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: e207e634dca54edbb7c44aea29372a9e
        position: {x: 940, y: 230}
        speaker:
          player: 0
          name: Sigrid
          model: {fileID: 983162859}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: Whatever you see, do not let go of the stone. There are things I should have told you, and there is no time left to tell them.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
    - rid: 2623125860895687005
      type: {class: HasHappenedNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: 84dbcc3b29e54c0589e42c12864911a9
        position: {x: 1240, y: 60}
        questEvent: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 316e769a318ba5a44b33770cbaf45924, type: 2}
    - rid: 2623125860895687006
      type: {class: SayNode, ns: , asm: SafeHaven}
      data:
        id: d59fb431b401430c99c964641566e518
        position: {x: 1540, y: 60}
        speaker:
          player: 1
          name: 
          model: {fileID: 0}
          portrait: {fileID: 0}
          voice: {fileID: 0}
          voiceFrom: {fileID: 0}
        line: The same marks as the stone by the lake, and the same warmth. It was already awake this morning.
        afterFightPause: 1
        aside: 0
